g><rect width=\"1457.2\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(3030.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(4086.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"34\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-34\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mspace\" transform=\"translate(4586.6,0)\"></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(4753.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"3A9\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3A9\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container><br><br>The equivalent circuit can be drawn as,<br><br> <img src=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1000/image/1kx9wir0q/8ef16fdb-1a5f-4e75-bc68-09ca53231c0d/333c5aa0-5ef3-11ec-85b8-4b78fdd0cc43/file-1kx9wir0r.png?format=png\" data-orsrc=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/image/1kx9wir0q/8ef16fdb-1a5f-4e75-bc68-09ca53231c0d/333c5aa0-5ef3-11ec-85b8-4b78fdd0cc43/file-1kx9wir0r.png\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0px auto;max-height:40vh\" alt=\"JEE Main 2021 (Online) 1st September Evening Shift Physics - Electromagnetic Induction Question 85 English Explanation\" srcset=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/500/image/1kx9wir0q/8ef16fdb-1a5f-4e75-bc68-09ca53231c0d/333c5aa0-5ef3-11ec-85b8-4b78fdd0cc43/file-1kx9wir0r.png?format=png 500w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/750/image/1kx9wir0q/8ef16fdb-1a5f-4e75-bc68-09ca53231c0d/333c5aa0-5ef3-11ec-85b8-4b78fdd0cc43/file-1kx9wir0r.png?format=png 750w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1000/image/1kx9wir0q/8ef16fdb-1a5f-4e75-bc68-09ca53231c0d/333c5aa0-5ef3-11ec-85b8-4b78fdd0cc43/file-1kx9wir0r.png?format=png 1000w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1500/image/1kx9wir0q/8ef16fdb-1a5f-4e75-bc68-09ca53231c0d/333c5aa0-5ef3-11ec-85b8-4b78fdd0cc43/file-1kx9wir0r.png?format=png 1500w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/2000/image/1kx9wir0q/8ef16fdb-1a5f-4e75-bc68-09ca53231c0d/333c5aa0-5ef3-11ec-85b8-4b78fdd0cc43/file-1kx9wir0r.png?forma